The following components are included in this library:

Ghostty (https://ghostty.org/) - the symbol constraint math in
src/backend/glyph_constraint/mod.rs is a port of Ghostty's
src/font/Glyph.zig, and tools/nerd_font_constraints.py is adapted from its
src/font/nerd_font_codegen.py, and
src/backend/programmatic_glyphs/box_lines.rs is a port of `linesChar` from its
src/font/sprite/draw/box.zig, and the wedge table in
src/backend/programmatic_glyphs/mosaic.rs is a port of the patterns in its
src/font/sprite/draw/symbols_for_legacy_computing.zig.
